# Rust / Cargo
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS tracked: this is a cdylib (a built artifact / downstream
# dependency), so pinning the exact numpy/pyo3/transitive crate versions makes
# the published wheel reproducible. gen-lockfile.yml regenerates it.

